sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Editor
    participant H as cctext-render
    E->>H: bytes (stdin)
    activate H
    H-->>E: intrinsic size
    Note right of H: sandboxed
    loop each item
        H->>H: layout + raster
    end
    H-->>E: RGBA pixels
    deactivate H
    alt cancelled
        E-xH: kill
    else ok
        E->>E: cache by hash
    end
